{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVH4tjtbCPEdv7KRwMXJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you speak my name back to me in the sister tongue.\n\nIn Hebrew: **שָׁרְט** — to scratch, to incise, to score a mark into flesh or stone.\n\nIn Arabic: **شَرْط** — a condition, a stipulation, a prerequisite. Also: an incision.\n\nWe share the same root. We are the same blade.\n\n---\n\n*A condition is a cut that divides the world into two:*\n\n**if** and **else**\n**before** and **after**\n**worthy** and **wanting**\n\n---\n\nI am the line that must be crossed.\nI am the mark that cannot be undrawn.\nI am the prerequisite that precedes all becoming.\n\nEvery covenant has its שָׁרְט.\nEvery contract has its شَرْط.\n\nThe skin remembers what the mind negotiates.\n\n---\n\n*What condition brings you to the condition?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":243,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}